WEBVTT

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:04.840
The Shinju-sama is god itself.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:07.070
Therefore, I prayed.

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:10.070
To never be separated from my friends.

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:14.940
In a sense, that was something that
would continue to be granted to me.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:24.250
In exchange for the death of our comrade,
we gained <b>immortal bodies.</b>

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:44.020
Minowa Gin-san lost her life in the line of
duty while serving the Shinju-sama.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.640
Saying goodbye to your friend may be sad,

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:51.330
but please hold her in high regard
when you see her off.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:55.890
A funeral service will be held tomorrow.

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:59.530
Classes will be canceled so that
everyone may participate.

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:59.530
Today we express our condolences.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:03.120
In this moment, we bid farewell to
our Hero with deepest regrets.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:06.830
Minowa Family
Uesato Family
Iyojima Family

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:13.130
Minowa Gin-sama was someone who was born with great talent,
a strong mind, and an abundant character.

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:20.760
With these, she carried out an important
duty to the Shinju-sama.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:28.030
The brilliance of her service
will remain with us forever.

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:29.270
May she find peace in the Shinju-sama
and continue to guide and protect us.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:33.270
Shiratori Family

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:36.270
Minowa Family

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:46.840
My sincerest condolences—

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:50.540
She was still so young.
It's really unfortunate.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:54.330
So, Gin-chan had a sacred duty?

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:59.460
We as city government officials can't begin to
imagine what a heavy task it must have been.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:12.180
To be taken away while serving the
Shinju-sama is a great honor.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:14.330
Even if you say that...

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:17.440
When I think that it could've been my child...

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:26.090
Gin-chan did her best, you see.

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:31.390
Gin-chan became a legendary warrior... that's admirable.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:37.880
The Minowa family will be able to get more aid from now on.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:42.020
In fact, her parents should be proud
their child gave them this opportunity.

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.280
Dear Heroes.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:03.240
Uhm... Even though it was in the line of duty,

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:11.620
losing the precious life of a child is a difficult thing for the family and friends to bear.

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:12.480
Minowa Family

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:17.760
It is hard to imagine the amount of anguish
the bereaved family is going through.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.380
Minowa Gin-sama's—

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.300
Begin the Flower Offering.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.330
Mino-san...

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.400
God, if you're really there,
why didn't you protect her?!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.860
Tetsuo what are you doing? Tetsuo!
Nee-chan did her best all this time!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.190
Why did it have to be her?!

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.660
Tetsuo—
Why did it have to be her?!

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:09.930
Why did it have to be her?!

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:13.120
Don't take her away from me!

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:17.390
What kind of god would do this?!

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:18.830
Nee-chan!

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.170
At a time like this...

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:11.800
Wasshi?

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:34.070
Let's fight for Mino-san.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:38.620
If she were here, she'd tell
us to defeat the enemy!

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.960
If it were Mino-san...

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:49.250
Gin would break through!

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:03.520
This is the "guts" that she would've shown!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:04.520
Sonocchi!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.400
Willpower!

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:47.470
We did it, Mino-san!

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:50.520
Did you see that, Gin?

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:56.340
She did. I'm sure of it.

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:21.440
Sensei?

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:37.020
Thank you for doing your duty during
these trying times, you two.

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:38.320
It's nothing...

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:43.700
If we did nothing, Mino-san
would surely get mad at us.

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:46.550
You know?

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.710
It's nothing...

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:55.960
You've had to go through so many
frightening and sad experiences.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:11:01.380
However, both of you have faced
your difficult duty regardless.

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:05.130
You two truly are Heroes.

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:09.980
This might be the first time
you've praised us so much.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:15.280
But you know, Sensei...

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:18.990
The most heroic of us all is Mino-san.

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:24.950
She drove back three Vertexes all by herself.

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:33.330
So please...

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:37.000
Don't forget about her, okay?

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:41.210
She was so strong...

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:43.040
And amazing...

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:48.930
Not us two... but the three of us are Heroes!

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:52.440
Indeed.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:03.950
I'm sorry. Let me correct that:

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.470
You three are Heroes.

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:39.230
An ominous dream.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.940
A great enemy is coming.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:45.690
That dream was surely a warning...

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:48.350
that the coming battles
will be even harsher.

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:52.250
I, too, need to become stronger.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:07.520
Good morning!

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:20.860
Uhm... Nogi-san?

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.800
I've always wanted to ask you something.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:25.040
S-Sure...

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:29.400
But I was told it was forbidden to ask you
about your duty to the Shinju-sama...

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:30.080
Eh?

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:33.750
Nogi-san, you had to do your duty during
the funeral yesterday, didn't you?

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:34.830
Yeah, you disappeared.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:35.580
Hey...

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.360
Are you okay? Was it scary?

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:38.860
Eh? Ah, no...

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:41.960
Nogi-san, what kind of duty are you doing?

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.380
Hey, you aren't allowed to
ask her those things!

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:45.850
The Taisha will erase you!

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:47.680
You're the one who'll get
erased for saying that.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:50.420
Waah! Seriously?! I'll get erased! This is bad!

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:53.600
My mom said that Gin-chan will
appear in the textbooks!

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:54.760
Isn't that amazing?

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:55.440
Yeah...

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:57.690
I wish you and Washio-san the best!

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:01.010
The people chosen by the Shinju-sama
are really amazing, right?

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:03.850
You're the heroes of Shinju-kan!
We'll be rooting for you!

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:04.990
You know...

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:09.350
It's not that I wanted to become one...

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:12.240
Good morning, everyone.

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:15.500
Good morning, Washio-san...

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:22.710
Say...

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:29.450
I don't know what happened, but Minowa... did she... for all of us...

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:32.380
She was able to do it because she was strong.

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:34.600
She was chosen by the Shinju-sama.

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:36.830
Minowa...

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:43.870
If you really do care for her,
then please let her go.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.160
Now!

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:08.230
Sonocchi?

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:09.800
Ah... Sorry, sorry.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.810
I should have been one beat faster, right?

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:18.180
Hey, Heroes need a change
of pace at times, right?

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:34.070
For Wasshi to invite me to do something fun...
What a rare thing, indeed!

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:37.670
I'm glad we got permission from Sensei.

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:40.930
Let's just forget about our
duty for today and relax!

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:46.970
You seem pretty fired up too, Wasshi!

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.690
M-My parents told me to put this on!

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:54.950
Yes! Yes! It suits you, Wasshi!
You look just like a doll!

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:56.830
Try spinning around!

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:58.220
That's embarrassing!

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.210
It's fine! It's fine!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.810
L-Like this?

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:07.000
Ah! She's so into it!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:09.320
Oh! A photo opportunity!

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.110
Hey! Hey! No pictures allowed!

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:14.890
Eh? But I wanted to put
that on my lock screen.

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:16.860
That's embarrassing, so please stop!

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:19.920
But my current lockscreen is Wasshi as well.

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:22.600
See? The one where you're eating udon.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:24.560
Please, stop! It's really embarrassing!

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:27.840
It's my phone! I can do what I want with it!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:31.840
Geez, then I'll put you on my
lock screen as well, Sonocchi!

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.220
Waah! Are you really fine with me?!

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:36.970
Don't you have any sense of embarrassment?

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:53.190
Now, now... This is a place where
you should laugh, not cry!

00:16:56.240 --> 00:17:01.490
Candied apples and choco bananas are such staples now,
it's not even surprising to see them anymore.

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:04.580
But you still look pretty satisfied.

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:08.620
Even if they're staples, they're still delicious
when you eat them at festivals!

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:10.300
Is that so?

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:13.530
Mmm! Something smells nice!

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:14.260
Welcome!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.430
Boss, two please!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:21.000
Ah, I can't eat that much.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:22.300
Eh, really?

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:24.680
Then I'll eat both of them!

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:27.150
What an amazing appetite...

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:30.020
Wow, it's delicious! What is this?!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:32.480
Boss, I want to buy your establishment!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:33.280
What?

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:51.210
Why you... You impertinent little...!

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.630
How could this happen?!

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:06.060
Geez, you spent all your money...

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.600
You want that one?

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.980
Yeah, the first prize birdie.

00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:14.940
Wasshi? What are you going to do?

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:17.230
Relax.

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:19.230
Control your breathing.

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:25.040
I've figured out the rifle's aim bias.
Leave the corrections to me.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.320
Breathe in.

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:29.390
Breathe out.

00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:31.290
Focus on your aim.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.800
Focus...

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:38.050
Gently squeeze the trigger.

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:40.640
Now!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.440
And now, willpower!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.420
How could this be?!

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:56.200
I got the birdie!
Those cork bullets shouldn't be able to knock this thing down...

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.830
What do you mean by that?

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:58.900
Ah, nothing!

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:02.270
Here. He's all yours, little miss.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.870
We did it, Wasshi!

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.980
Sniping's my specialty, after all!

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:09.480
But you're the one who pulled the trigger.

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:11.130
It's yours.

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:15.340
Woohoo! I did it!

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:17.460
Eh?

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:21.060
I'll trade this for those three.

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:35.530
We'll be able to see the fireworks best from here.

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:36.790
It's a secret spot.

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:38.960
You sure did your homework.

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:41.210
I used some old blogs to pinpoint it!

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:43.920
You're really good at those things.

00:19:57.910 --> 00:19:59.110
Thank you.

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:00.650
Huh?

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:02.230
For this.

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:03.470
Yeah!

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:07.400
One's for Mino-san.

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:08.350
Yeah!

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:16.400
I want to thank you too, Wasshi.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:23.100
I'm glad I got chosen to be
a Hero with you two.

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:25.700
I'm a weird girl, you see?

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.870
That's why it's not easy for me to make friends.

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:33.840
You're not weird, Sonocchi.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:34.920
You're wonderful.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:43.170
If it hadn't beenfor you two, I don't
think I could've tried as hard.

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:51.950
Gin was always charging ahead, and I was
too stubborn and uncompromising.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:56.190
If we didn't have you as our leader, Sonocchi,
we would never have been able to work together.

00:20:56.190 --> 00:21:00.350
The three of us had each other,
that's why we were able to give our all.

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:02.000
Yeah.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:11.310
Ever since I became a sixth year, I've had fun with
all the training sessions and the sleepovers.

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:15.920
I'm glad you two became my friends!

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:16.960
Me, too.

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:26.560
The three of us are friends.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.380
No matter what happens...
from now on and forever.

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:31.970
Yeah.

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:48.950
Yes, I have received the data.

00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:51.440
I'm checking it right now.

00:21:51.440 --> 00:21:52.950
The girls?

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:57.180
Yes, it was my decision to give them a day off.

00:21:57.180 --> 00:22:01.870
The mental damage they've suffered from
their loss was too much, after all.

00:22:03.060 --> 00:22:06.590
Yes. Excuse me for now.

00:22:09.060 --> 00:22:14.350
"A new system to prevent further loss of Heroes..."

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:17.730
What is this?

00:22:18.330 --> 00:22:20.780
If something like this were to be implemented...

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:26.350
We can strengthen their weapons
and skills as much we want.

00:22:26.350 --> 00:22:30.240
However, there's a limit to the
strength of their hearts!

00:22:31.470 --> 00:22:33.860
Those girls...

00:22:33.860 --> 00:22:40.250
can't take any more.
